window.bookSummaryJSON = "<p>When an active shooter storms her workplace, survival instinct takes over — and with her first taste of blood, the transformation begins. Half-wolf, half-vampire, Waya is a werepire, long lost from a hidden pack deep in the Kentucky woods.</p> <p>Plucked from the chaos and thrust into a brutal new world, Waya struggles with her growing thirst, her dangerous beauty, and a pack that views her as both prize and threat. Desperate for survival, she forges uneasy alliances — with a wandering preacher, a vampire district attorney, and even the darkness inside herself.</p> <p>But freedom comes at a cost. Blood is life. Waya needs it every day, and it comes at a cost.</p> <p>When betrayal strikes and the pack turns on her, she faces a terrible choice: submit and be sacrificed — or unleash the full fury of the creature she was born to become.</p> <p>Power. Blood. Survival.</p> <p>Waya’s journey has only begun.</p>"; 
